WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.724 --> 00:00:14.429
Terrell "Roxy?"

2
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.390
Roxy gulped.

3
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.471
Terrell knew her secret!

4
00:00:19.391 --> 00:00:20.372
She took a deep breath.

5
00:00:24.674 --> 00:00:25.674
hi, Terrell."

6
00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:28.135
Terrell's eyes were wide.

7
00:00:28.155 --> 00:00:29.956
"I knew it, Roxy!

8
00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:32.566
I knew you were Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:32.586 --> 00:00:35.909
"Yes," Roxy said slowly.

10
00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:39.632
"But listen, you can't tell anyone, okay?

11
00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.836
Only two other people know—Principal Penn and Mayor Bloom."

12
00:00:44.737 --> 00:00:46.498
Terrell placed his hand over his heart.

13
00:00:46.518 --> 00:00:49.261
"I promise to keep it a secret."

14
00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:51.022
He looked around.

15
00:00:51.983 --> 00:00:52.904
"What happened here?"

16
00:00:54.185 --> 00:00:54.926
Roxy frowned.

17
00:00:54.946 --> 00:00:56.828
"I was talking to Mayor Bloom.

18
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.001
Suddenly something sucked away all the kids and teachers.

19
00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:03.062
But I don't know what it was."

20
00:01:03.082 --> 00:01:06.043
"Why were you talking to Mayor Bloom?"

21
00:01:06.264 --> 00:01:07.004
Terrell asked.

22
00:01:07.804 --> 00:01:11.126
"Something odd happened at Metro City Prison," Roxy said.

23
00:01:11.146 --> 00:01:13.407
"I can't tell you about that right now.

24
00:01:14.047 --> 00:01:15.567
I have to get there right away."

25
00:01:15.587 --> 00:01:17.968
"Okay," Terrell said.

26
00:01:17.988 --> 00:01:21.190
"Maybe I can stay here and look for clues or something."

27
00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:22.750
Roxy nodded.

28
00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:23.811
"Good idea.

29
00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:26.252
If you need me, call me on my watch."

30
00:01:27.636 --> 00:01:29.978
Roxy gave Terrell the special number for Rocket Girl.

31
00:01:30.698 --> 00:01:31.719
He put it into his phone.

32
00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:38.543
Roxy arrived at Metro City Prison.

33
00:01:39.544 --> 00:01:41.545
She saw a big hole in the side of the building.

34
00:01:42.306 --> 00:01:43.927
She flew through it and into the prison.

35
00:01:45.608 --> 00:01:46.749
Detective Smith jumped.

36
00:01:47.309 --> 00:01:47.990
"Rocket Girl!

37
00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.171
You startled me!"

38
00:01:49.191 --> 00:01:52.313
"Sorry, Detective," Roxy said.

39
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:53.634
"I'm in a rush.

40
00:01:54.174 --> 00:01:56.876
This hole isn't the only thing that happened this morning."

41
00:01:58.544 --> 00:01:59.505
"What else happened?"

42
00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:00.906
Detective Smith asked.

43
00:02:02.027 --> 00:02:03.969
Roxy told him about the event at school.

44
00:02:05.009 --> 00:02:05.910
He rubbed his chin.

45
00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:09.213
"Hmm Two very weird events."

46
00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:11.995
"Do you think they are connected?"

47
00:02:12.295 --> 00:02:13.056
Roxy asked.

48
00:02:13.996 --> 00:02:15.057
The detective sighed.

49
00:02:16.198 --> 00:02:17.259
"I have no idea."

50
00:02:17.279 --> 00:02:20.402
"Me neither," Roxy said.

51
00:02:21.362 --> 00:02:22.143
Suddenly Mrs.

52
00:02:22.203 --> 00:02:23.304
Wiggles sat up in bed.

53
00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:26.366
"I hate bedtime!"

54
00:02:26.987 --> 00:02:28.028
Roxy rolled her eyes.

55
00:02:29.072 --> 00:02:30.313
"It's morning, Mrs.

56
00:02:30.433 --> 00:02:32.874
Wiggles. It's not bedtime."

57
00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:35.695
Roxy looked around.

58
00:02:35.715 --> 00:02:39.356
"Mayor Bloom said all the prisoners are still here."

59
00:02:40.537 --> 00:02:41.617
Detective Smith nodded.

60
00:02:41.637 --> 00:02:44.818
"The guards have counted the prisoners several times.

61
00:02:45.199 --> 00:02:46.199
Nobody is missing."

62
00:02:47.439 --> 00:02:48.320
Roxy shook her head.

63
00:02:53.522 --> 00:02:54.902
who made this hole?

64
00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:55.943
And why?"

65
00:02:56.903 --> 00:02:58.664
Roxy looked more closely at the hole.

66
00:02:59.576 --> 00:03:02.879
"The surface inside the hole is perfectly smooth."

67
00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.261
Detective Smith nodded.

68
00:03:05.281 --> 00:03:08.243
"There aren't any chips or broken bits of wall.

69
00:03:09.024 --> 00:03:11.786
It's very odd."

70
00:03:11.807 --> 00:03:13.268
"I hate bedtime!"

71
00:03:13.588 --> 00:03:14.789
Mrs. Wiggles said again.

72
00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:17.491
Roxy turned around.

73
00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:21.555
"It's not—" "I hate bedtime!

74
00:03:22.456 --> 00:03:24.077
I hate bedtime!"

75
00:03:24.838 --> 00:03:26.779
A tiny puff of smoke drifted from Mrs.

76
00:03:26.819 --> 00:03:27.360
Wiggles' ear.

77
00:03:28.716 --> 00:03:30.918
"That's strange," Roxy thought.

78
00:03:32.099 --> 00:03:34.161
Using her x-ray vision, she looked at Mrs.

79
00:03:34.201 --> 00:03:38.546
Wiggles. Inside the villain, Roxy saw gears and springs.

80
00:03:39.647 --> 00:03:40.547
Roxy gasped.

81
00:03:40.908 --> 00:03:42.249
"That's not Mrs.

82
00:03:42.329 --> 00:03:44.191
Wiggles! It's a robot!"
